    "status": "monitoring",
    "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=17.1,108.5",
    "official_link": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=17.1,108.5",
    "country_code": null,
    "payload": {
      "item_type": "disturbance",
      "source": "jtwc_abpw",
      "source_key": "jtwc_abpw|western_north_pacific_area|invest_98w",
      "content_hash": "1207edf80b91139e",
      "platform_summary": "17.1N 108.5E | winds 23-28 kt | 1006 mb",
      "platform_location": "17.1N 108.5E",
      "wind": "23-28 kt",
      "risk_48h": null,
      "risk_7d": null,
      "next_update": null,
      "raw_text": "(1) THE AREA OF CONVECTION (INVEST 98W) PREVIOUSLY LOCATED NEAR \n17.0N 109.1E IS NOW LOCATED NEAR 17.1N 108.5E, APPROXIMATELY 67 NM \nNORTH-NORTHEAST OF DA NANG VIETNAM. ANIMATED ENHANCED INFRARED (EIR) \nDEPICTS A BROAD AREA OF DISORGANIZED DEEP CONVECTION ASSOCIATED WITH A \nSLOWLY CONSOLIDATING LOW-LEVEL CIRCULATION CENTER (LLCC). THE LLCC \nREMAINS BROAD AND ELONGATED, WITH THE WESTERN EXTENT OF THE \nCIRCULATION LIKELY EXTENDING OVER LAND. CURRENT ANALYSIS OF THE \nSURROUNDING ENVIRONMENT INDICATES FAVORABLE CONDITIONS FOR FURTHER \nCONSOLIDATION WITH LOW (10-15 KTS) VERTICAL WIND SHEAR, STRONG \nEQUATORWARD OUTFLOW ALOFT, WARM (28-29 C) SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURES, \nAND DEEP MOISTURE THROUGHOUT THE AIR COLUMN BEING OFFSET BY LAND \nINTERACTION. GLOBAL DETERMINISTIC MODELS ARE IN GOOD AGREEMENT THAT \n98W WILL TRACK GENERALLY NORTHWESTWARD, SKIRTING THE COAST OF VIETNAM, \nPOTENTIALLY REACHING TROPICAL DEPRESSION CRITERIA DURING THE NEXT 12-\n24 HOURS. THERE REMAINS SIGNIFICANT UNCERTAINTY AS TO WHETHER THE \nBROAD SYSTEM CAN ORGANIZE BEFORE IT MAKES LANDFALL IN VIETNAM AND \nTRANSITS INLAND. MAXIMUM SUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE ESTIMATED AT 23 \nTO 28 KNOTS. MINIMUM SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED TO BE NEAR 1006 \nMB. THE POTENTIAL FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL \nCYCLONE WITHIN THE NEXT 24 HOURS IS HIGH.",
      "metadata": {
        "basin_section": "WESTERN NORTH PACIFIC AREA (180 TO MALAY PENINSULA)",
        "invest_id": "98W",
        "lat": 17.1,
        "lon": 108.5,
